{"ticker":"UBL","symbol":"UBL","instrumentId":3022628,"name":"United Breweries","industry":"NSE-Beverages-Alcoholic","about":"United Breweries Ltd. is India's largest beer producer, renowned for its iconic Kingfisher brand. The company manufactures a wide portfolio of alcoholic beverages, including premium, strong, and light beers, catering to diverse consumer preferences. With a dominant market share in India, United Breweries operates several state-of-the-art breweries across the country, ensuring high-quality production. It also exports to international markets, extending its global reach. United Breweries focuses on innovation, product development, and sustainability, continuously evolving to meet customer demands while maintaining environmental stewardship through efficient water usage and energy-saving practices in its manufacturing processes.","website":"www.unitedbreweries.com","location":"Bangalore, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T14:06:42.826Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1271.6,"changePct":3.9738348323793873,"week52High":1758.2,"week52Low":1136.2},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹33,622 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹9,927 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"76,677,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"164"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"59,843,682"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.79%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"7.43"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.3"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.12"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.47"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"4%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"69.41"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"78–177"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"9.1%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"16.45"},{"label":"Volume","value":"187,513"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"296,727"},{"label":"Master score","value":"60"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"67"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"37"},{"label":"Group